# Walk up the lab's 3-stair (0.17 m risers) onto the 0.51 m platform: each riser is a step-up
# (walk.stepHeight 0.25), no climbing.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 16 5.5 0.13 0
tap walk 10
hold up 20..200
run 200
expect no event climb
expect skater.pos.z > 0.62 at end
expect skater.pos.y > 9 at end
expect state walk at end
